# ==============================================================================
# Head Kidney Granuloma - 6. Spatial Feature Mapping of Representative Genes
# ==============================================================================
#
# Purpose:
#   Generate spatial feature plots for representative genes from functional
#   programs in the integrated and annotated head kidney spatial transcriptomics
#   dataset.
#
# Required input:
#   seu_int_rpca:
#     Integrated and annotated Seurat object generated by:
#       01_HK_ST_Control_Infected_RPCA_Integration.R
#       02_HK_ST_Integrated_Domain_Annotation.R
#
# Main outputs generated in memory:
#   spatial_feature_plots
#
# Notes:
#   This script does not save figures to disk. Users can export plots as needed.
# ==============================================================================


# ==============================================================================
# --- 0. Load R packages ---
# ==============================================================================

